<view class="page paper-grain safe-bottom"><view wx:if="{{expired}}" class="expired"><view class="storybook-title">这页分享已经回到抽屉里了</view><text>分享链接已过期，请让家长重新生成一份精选分享。</text></view><view wx:if="{{share && !expired}}" class="book"><view class="kicker">A LITTLE SHARED MEMORY</view><view class="storybook-title title">{{share.title}}</view><view class="range">{{share.dateRange}}</view><view class="memory">“{{share.memory}}”</view><view wx:for="{{share.days}}" wx:key="dayNumber" class="day"><view class="day-title"><text class="day-number">D{{item.dayNumber}}</text><text>{{item.city}} · {{item.title}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{item.photos}}" wx:key="displayUrl" class="shared-photo"><image src="{{item.displayUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"></image></view><view wx:if="{{item.diary}}" class="diary">{{item.diary.parentNote}}<view class="quote">{{item.diary.childQuote}}</view></view></view><view class="privacy">这是家长精选的只读分享，7天后失效；住宿和实时位置未包含在内。</view></view></view>
